: "John Autism", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198064514823/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 863762, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3415, "playtime_at_review": 7977, "last_played": 1789006360, "avatar": "056af4bdd6b56ad908e45b674cdef67575b93b40"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alright, let me be honest. Warframe is an Amazing game. A gem tenderly being polished by the Devs. Sometimes it cracks and a scratches. But yet still is a familiar experience. The Games Powerscaling have had a rough road. I'd Recommend you to search for a Clan where you can make In-game Friends or Bring your Friends along the ride. It will Boost your Experience Exponentialy. As an Autistic Solo Player. My most Valued time in the game has been with the Friends i made and dragged along the Way. Even if i Lost my Connection with the game For the time beeing. It had the largest impact on my life.", "timestamp_created": 1367954885, "timestamp_updated": 1679246376, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "6074990", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058498213", "personaname": "B33R GAMING", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SeattleSamurai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 638, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 636, "last_played": 1435695651, "avatar": "5d00e2a461a5c8e380b2d08ad0d9d902d756330e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing third person game. it DOES require a speperate account then your steam account, but it is super simple compared to other games. amazing costumbility and combat system. if you are looking for a game to play for hours on end this is your game. online multiplayer is buggy, if a match ends the game freezes on the loading of the menu, but minor bugs like that are to be expected in an open beta. amazing game. if they got rid of the in game \"crystals\", which is in game currenct that you have to pay for, and charged about 15-20 dollars for the game i would still buy it. amazing game. i give it a 11/10", "timestamp_created": 1367950443, "timestamp_updated": 1367950443, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6641963", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071227477", "personaname": "Krystolyte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Krystolyte/", "num_games_owned": 156, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 109443, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 436, "last_played": 1787768803, "avatar": "c3c67625cde0c8eec8c54d862e4fa2453afec5ab"}, "language": "english", "review": "get it", "timestamp_created": 1367946733, "timestamp_updated": 1367946733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}